  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Whole Jurassic animal, not isolated carapace. Shape anchor lectotype MNHN.F.A32407, early Tithonian Solnhofen. Conservative living restoration, not a scan. {\"units\": \"meters\", \"carapace_length_measured\": 0.0505, \"uropodal_exopod_length_measured\": 0.0097, \"body_length_estimated\": 0.095, \"carapace_width_estimated\": 0.057, \"body_thickness_inferred\": 0.012, \"note\": \"CLmax and UL from Audo et al Table1 same specimen. 95mm body and57mm width approximate Fig1B 2cm scale, uncertainty roughly5mm; thickness cannot be measured in compressed fossil. Overall span includes articulated legs and is not body length.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Whole Jurassic animal, not isolated carapace. Shape anchor lectotype MNHN.F.A32407, early Tithonian Solnhofen. Conservative living restoration, not a scan. {\"units\": \"meters\", \"carapace_length_measured\": 0.0505, \"uropodal_exopod_length_measured\": 0.0097, \"body_length_estimated\": 0.095, \"carapace_width_estimated\": 0.057, \"body_thickness_inferred\": 0.012, \"note\": \"CLmax and UL from Audo et al Table1 same specimen. 95mm body and57mm width approximate Fig1B 2cm scale, uncertainty roughly5mm; thickness cannot be measured in compressed fossil. Overall span includes articulated legs and is not body length.\"}"
